        "x0": 0.05951222535211267,
        "y0": 0.8940282165875861,
        "x1": 0.39351588597183096,
        "y1": 0.9032129555329599
      },
      "text": "LAVER. (1) The remainder. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05991707042253521,
        "y0": 0.9068673238468965,
        "x1": 0.48986253521126744,
        "y1": 0.9284116431778366
      },
      "text": "(2) A cistern, trough, or conduit, to wash in. \" Laver to washe at, lavoyr\" Palsgrave. Also,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08137385915492958,
        "y0": 0.9351290738648276,
        "x1": 0.4886463806197183,
        "y1": 0.9428402585836807
      },
      "text": "a basin. See Florio, p. 89 ; Cotgravp, in v.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5331809577464789,
        "y0": 0.07414125419172411,
        "x1": 0.9432857753239433,
        "y1": 0.09585458054492639
      },
      "text": "Esguiere ,' Leg. Cathol. p. 154 ; Reliq. Antiq. i. 7; Davies' Ancient Rites, 1672, p. 130.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5307518873239436,
        "y0": 0.09975715865655177,
        "x1": 0.7044239450140845,
        "y1": 0.10720170454672014
      },
      "text": "And fulleglad, certys, thou schalt bee,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5311567323943661,
        "y0": 0.11086171419172423,
        "x1": 0.7388398244507042,
        "y1": 0.1198745648837827
      },
      "text": "Yf that y wylle sufifur the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5311567323943661,
        "y0": 0.12300357626068975,
        "x1": 0.942880930253521,
        "y1": 0.14257806983891466
      },
      "text": "To hulde me a lavour and bason to my honde. MS. Cantab. Ff. ii.38, f. 144.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.512129014084507,
        "y0": 0.14690249753241383,
        "x1": 0.9436970979154927,
        "y1": 0.18265868054267434
      },
      "text": "(3) A dish composed of a kind of sea-weed well washed and boiled. It is also called laver^ bread, Kennett, MS. Lansd. 1033.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5109144788732394,
        "y0": 0.18868424565517242,
        "x1": 0.7651604218591548,
        "y1": 0.2102128114588017
      },
      "text": "(4) Laver lip, a hanging lip. LAVERD. Lord. {A.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.569617014084507,
        "y0": 0.21436169201517252,
        "x1": 0.8380292957746478,
        "y1": 0.23374025252946667
      },
      "text": "That tay after thaym ne went To du thayr laverd comandement.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6975480563380281,
        "y0": 0.23801048101655184,
        "x1": 0.9420736691830986,
        "y1": 0.2451644146665009
      },
      "text": "Guy of Warwick, Middlehill MS.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5109144788732394,
        "y0": 0.24970478413793118,
        "x1": 0.9453148588169012,
        "y1": 0.2993258255018935
      },
      "text": "LAVEROCK. The lark. North. See Wright's Lyric Poetry, pp. 26, 40 ; Reliq. Antiq. i. 86 ; Wright's Purgatory, p. 55 ; laverkes, Beves of Hamtoun, p. 138,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.568807323943662,
        "y0": 0.3041089295834483,
        "x1": 0.8351889027605632,
        "y1": 0.31092304764240336
      },
      "text": "Sche made many a wondir soune,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.568807323943662,
        "y0": 0.31534263984000005,
        "x1": 0.7959254084507043,
        "y1": 0.323089979321774
      },
      "text": "Sumtyme liche unto the cok,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.568807323943662,
        "y0": 0.327268738542069,
        "x1": 0.7845929852394365,
        "y1": 0.3349760535835734
      },
      "text": "Sumlyme unto the laverok.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6829736338028168,
        "y0": 0.3400931516703449,
        "x1": 0.9416663950422535,
        "y1": 0.34632826338714556
      },
      "text": "Gower, MS. Sac. Antiq. 134, f. 152.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5692121690140844,
        "y0": 0.3539377141379312,
        "x1": 0.8521988732394365,
        "y1": 0.3728614626862563
      },
      "text": "Tyrlery lovpyn, the laverocke songe, So meryly pypes the sparow ;",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5684024788732394,
        "y0": 0.3769139678772414,
        "x1": 0.8829630501408451,
        "y1": 0.39628131990187376
      },
      "text": "The cow brake lose, the rope ran home, Syr, God gyve yow good morow.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.742890704225352,
        "y0": 0.40226451070758634,
        "x1": 0.9424801336338025,
        "y1": 0.4072919284440744
      },
      "text": "Bliss's Bibl. Miscell. p. 54.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.41335007042344823,
        "x1": 0.9424858014647886,
        "y1": 0.4756022681906102
      },
      "text": "LAVISH. Rank, as grass, &c. West. LA-VOLTA. A kind of very active bouncing waltz, formerly much in fashion. The man turned the woman round several times, and then assisted her in making a high spring.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5679976338028169,
        "y0": 0.48027320417379316,
        "x1": 0.8724427461408452,
        "y1": 0.48740943820267096
      },
      "text": "Leave protestations now, and let us hie",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.568807323943662,
        "y0": 0.49147192108827586,
        "x1": 0.8781049092957744,
        "y1": 0.499593402076919
      },
      "text": "To tread lavolta, that is women's walk.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.725482366197183,
        "y0": 0.5044621424937932,
        "x1": 0.9416696338028169,
        "y1": 0.5105945828203367
      },
      "text": "Soliman and Perseda, p. 214.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5959319436619718,
        "y0": 0.5171021083475862,
        "x1": 0.8084820831549295,
        "y1": 0.5246364522208212
      },
      "text": "Lavish : liberal. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.5162983121227587,
        "x1": 0.5720501329577463,
        "y1": 0.5252898896390045
      },
      "text": "LAVY.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.5292154048275862,
        "x1": 0.9416663950422535,
        "y1": 0.5650500170024165
      },
      "text": "LAW. (1) To give a hare good law, i. e. a good start before the hounds. It is in very frequent use by boys at play.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5096999436619718,
        "y0": 0.5693897389117242,
        "x1": 0.7995754916056338,
        "y1": 0.5804638956932187
      },
      "text": "(2) A hill, or eminence. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5096999436619718,
        "y0": 0.5843401127944827,
        "x1": 0.8671813796056337,
        "y1": 0.5943403094863221
      },
      "text": "(3) Custom ; manner. See Ellis, ii. 335.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5096999436619718,
        "y0": 0.5981399337393104,
        "x1": 0.6647556056338028,
        "y1": 0.6079883955415515
      },
      "text": "(4) Low. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5679976338028169,
        "y0": 0.6100173807434484,
        "x1": 0.8392405922253522,
        "y1": 0.6417105464544114
      },
      "text": "He wist not that hym was gode. But then he putte doune his hode On knees he fel downe latvc.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7250775211267605,
        "y0": 0.6457847144827586,
        "x1": 0.9404526695211267,
        "y1": 0.6527454867035799
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. v. 48, f. 55.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.6565054137213794,
        "x1": 0.8100949859154929,
        "y1": 0.6677192177691224
      },
      "text": "LAWAND. Bowing ; humbUng.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5323712676056338,
        "y0": 0.6707647372413793,
        "x1": 0.942479323943662,
        "y1": 0.7134547970484074
      },
      "text": "Anely lawand thameselfe to the sacramenles of haly kyrke, thof it be swa that thay hafebenecumbyrde in syne and with syne alle thaire lyfe tyme. MS. Lincoln A. 1. 17, f229.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5088902535211267,
        "y0": 0.7202015775324138,
        "x1": 0.8505770638873239,
        "y1": 0.7303885840976416
      },
      "text": "LAWE. (1) To laugh. Nominale MS.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.7346654889503449,
        "x1": 0.8250783019718309,
        "y1": 0.7445223955415515
      },
      "text": "(2) Rough ; violent ; brutal. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5096999436619718,
        "y0": 0.7470407721227587,
        "x1": 0.8072562122816902,
        "y1": 0.757121041221694
      },
      "text": "LAWED. Ignorant. See Laird.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5088902535211267,
        "y0": 0.7608629638289656,
        "x1": 0.8436955073802817,
        "y1": 0.7704827510381405
      },
      "text": "LAWES. The same as Kaims, q. v.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5088902535211267,
        "y0": 0.7739486500055173,
        "x1": 0.8206160996056338,
        "y1": 0.7836276037785691
      },
      "text": "LAWESTE. The lowest. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5291325070422535,
        "y0": 0.787288859346207,
        "x1": 0.890662393690141,
        "y1": 0.794843513311312
      },
      "text": "Lenges all at laysere, and lokes one the wallys",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5299421971830985,
        "y0": 0.7998812984827586,
        "x1": 0.8947132734647884,
        "y1": 0.807190109314621
      },
      "text": "Whare they ware latveate the ledes to assaille.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6720428169014083,
        "y0": 0.8118215907737931,
        "x1": 0.9404559082816899,
        "y1": 0.818143712143354
      },
      "text": "Morte Arthure, MS. Lincoln, f. 79»",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5084854084507042,
        "y0": 0.8234419078303449,
        "x1": 0.6667927860281689,
        "y1": 0.8328928963131649
      },
      "text": "LAWFUL-CASE.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6902608450704224,
        "y0": 0.8229505886206897,
        "x1": 0.8857912978028174,
        "y1": 0.8320866021605176
      },
      "text": "An interj. of surprize.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5088902535211267,
        "y0": 0.8363770150937931,
        "x1": 0.8287178591549296,
        "y1": 0.8599096441011173
      },
      "text": "LAWGHE. Low. Hampole. LAWING. (1) Going to law. IJnc.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5088902535211267,
        "y0": 0.8644694926868965,
        "x1": 0.9400437760000003,
        "y1": 0.8863274843018475
      },
      "text": "(2) Lawing of dogs, i. e. cutting out the balls, or three claws of the fore-feet.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.8898547265517243,
        "x1": 0.8736483747605631,
        "y1": 0.8998644678320815
      },
      "text": "LAWLESS-MAN. An outlaw. {A.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5092950985915493,
        "y0": 0.9038018951875862,
        "x1": 0.8364115348732393,
        "y1": 0.9137784219730782
      },
      "text": "LAWN. The same as Launde, q. v.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5101047887323944,
        "y0": 0.9170434630496551,
        "x1": 0.9404534792112673,
        "y1": 0.9400697372975758
      },
      "text": "LAWNDER. The sliding iron in the fore-part of a plough. I'ar. dial.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
  ],
